{"id":"5a32c3b00cffaa99","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 True Cofinality","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality — ZFC Pcf3 True Cofinality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality — ZFC Pcf3 True Cofinality","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality — ZFC Pcf3 True Cofinality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6573583f2357d706\" href=\"?note=6573583f2357d706\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" href=\"?note=eddbbbc6fc10dcfa\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S\\)</span> (cofinal-chain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6573583f2357d706\" href=\"?note=6573583f2357d706\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}true\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\exists\\vec f\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}true\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\exists\\vec f\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reduced product has true cofinality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> exactly when it admits a cofinal chain of regular length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6573583f2357d706","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set","status":"resolved","id":"eddbbbc6fc10dcfa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-ideal-on-cardinal-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6573583f2357d706","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S$ (cofinal-chain predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (regular-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A,J,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}true\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\e